activty 1: stakeholers 

1. patients 
needs: being able to book, view and cancel appointments easily. confident their personal data stays private.
potential conflict: wanting fast self service can cause conflict with staff needing to verify identity but also needed to protect patient data

2. receptionsts
needs: the ability to quickly create, find and update appointments without dupiclates. 
potential conflict: wants simple, low friction workflow which can cause conflict with managment wanting more detailed reports. 

3. GP's
needs: an accurate, up to date view of their own schedule and patients history
potential conflict: wants minimal admin work themselves but depends on receptionist data accuracy and efficiency

4. clinic management
needs: reliable appoinment history and simple operantial reports.
potential conflict: wants detailed reports and better data storage, which can cause confilict with the clients request for a simple low cost program. 

5. system owner
needs: needs the system to be simple enough to maintain and update without a dedicated it department
potential confict: may conflict with staff or magement requests for extra featuers beyond a managable application

